<p>WhatsApp now shows ads in <strong>Status</strong>, between the Status updates people tap through every day. For Indian businesses this is a big new placement: WhatsApp is where customers already talk to shops, clinics, builders and service providers. This guide explains how Status ads work, how to set one up, what it costs and when it is worth testing.</p>

<p><strong>Details were checked on November 16, 2026.</strong> Meta is still rolling some features out in stages, so check what your own Ads Manager account shows before planning a campaign.</p>

